us  explosives as cover an unspecified  amount of time later vash comes across a  newspaper with a piece of news that says  he was the mastermind behind the robbery  much to his dismay twenty years later  gasback's former henchmen are living a  life of ease however their luxury life  turns into a living hell when gasback  returns and takes revenge on one of them  he destroys his casino forcing him to  take refuge elsewhere on the other hand  kane has become the mayor of maca city  under the name kepler he's built a huge  revolving statue of himself with the  robbery money fearful that gas back will  come for him kane insures the statute  for five billion dollars this results in  millie and merrill the insurance agents  coming to the city to prevent the  disaster from happening as their company  would go bankrupt in this case upon  entering the city they meet some rogue  men trying to flirt with them but they  back off after witnessing the huge  machine gun carried by milli they find  the city bursting with bounty hunters  and learn from the marshal that kane has  hired bounty hunters instead of  bodyguards to deal with gasback's  invasion this upsets merrell who  realizes it will be very difficult to  protect the statue in case a battle  breaks out between bounty hunters and  gasbag elsewhere on a sand steamer vash  and numerous other passengers mostly  bounty hunters are traveling to maca  city on the ship two rogue bounty  hunters pick on a pretty girl named  amelia just when the fight's about to  get really dangerous vash steps in and  ridicules the offenders with his silly  tricks amidst his tricks vash saves  amelia and the other passengers as a  punishment the crew members of the ship  throw the offenders out of the ship  along with their luggage they're trying  to apologize but it's all in vain  vash ends up following her because of  his habit of chasing pretty girls  emilia's annoyed by his childlike  advances on her he touches her hand  leading her into further trouble because  she's allergic to foolish men meanwhile  gassback has recruited the skilled  warrior wolfwood as his bodyguard  despite having good intentions he ends  up serving gas back because he once  saved him from dying wolford has a  contract with him and he must escort him  to the house of the mayor of marco city  on the other hand two girls from the  insurance company reached the house of  the mayor upon meeting him they present  him with a gift and suddenly armed  officers cover the place and take the  parcel for checking as it could be a  bomb sent by gasback the mayor tells him  that he needs insurance worth five  billion dollars for his statue because  it's a great asset for the town the  girls tried to negotiate with him but  he's fixated on insuring the statute he  also tells him to insure the power plant  but back off after hearing that it's not  possible to insure a power plant back in  the city vash is still trying to impress  a media she beats him to the ground for  troubling her the two end up in a bar  and share a table with meryl and millie  as the night goes on everyone in the bar  gets high on alcohol this leads to a  huge brawl breaking out just when things  are going to get ugly vash steals the  bullets from everyone's guns to stop the  fight milly and vash head for their  rooms each carrying an intoxicated  amelia and merrell respectively emilia  experiences a flashback in which she is  talking to her mother her mother brings  in a suitcase and says it has a secret  in it which will tell her the future  however her mother falls ill on a  deathbed she tries to tell her about the  case but fails to do so because of a  serious condition as everyone sleeps  gaspak attacks and destroys a factory  owned by gasback's second henchman  forcing him to stay with kane wolford's  magnificent weapon called cross punisher  is revealed in this fight gaspar uses  his electronic arm capable of generating  powerful electric shocks he wipes out  the entire fleet of robots by using  these electric shocks word spreads that  the attack on maca city is only a hoax  and everyone starts to leave emilia is  leaving and vash begins to follow her  but suddenly stomps despite knowing that  gasback will attack this city for sure  he wanted to keep her away from the  danger emilia becomes suspicious of him  and asks him to reveal the truth during  their conversation gasback arrives early  in the morning stating the robbery will  be quite the show the bounty hunters  still hungover from the night before  serve as minor annoyances as gasbag  plows his way through the city upon  reaching kane's doorstep he's briefly  halted by vash wolfwood distracts vash  long enough for gasback to enter the  mansion at this wolfwood states his  contract is complete letting vash inside  gasback discovers that kane has  non-fatally shot the other two henchmen  claiming that they were the ones at  fault death decaying's pleased gas back  is about to get even when vash and  amelia burst into the room vash hopes to  settle things peacefully but emilia  wants gas back dead vash ends up putting  his finger in emilia's gun to stop her  from firing during the conflict kane and  gaspak escape again and emilia learns  vash was the one who let gas back escape  20 years ago she furiously tells him  that countless lives were affected by  his decision of letting gas back live  swearing to see the outlaw die  gasback finds kane telling him that he  doesn't intend to kill him instead he  plans to rob him clean he sets off a  series of explosions that remove the  town's light bulb-like power plant from  its cradle it rolls through town and  destroys the statue to meryl and  millie's great dismay and a special  getaway hover vehicle secures it the  remaining bounty hunters including a  media chase after him vash and wolf  would follow pulling between emilia and  gasback's vehicles trying to stop them  from damaging the plant flash is  suddenly shot by the marshall who's  shown to be working with gas back he  falls and disappears into a pit of dry  quicksand walford tries to save him but  only manages to pull out his sunglasses  grieved over the loss emilia wonders  that she's not too different from the  outlaw back of the now powerless town  immediate tells girls from the insurance  company the vash is dead a media makes  up a mind to destroy the plan of gas  back while claiming back the power plant  of the city because countless people are  suffering wolfwood now wearing flash's  sunglasses agrees to take down gas back  and bring back the plant immediate joins  in the battle they fight bravely but are  quickly overwhelmed by the outlaws  firepower wolfwood provides cover and  tells her to get the powerplant back she  manages to get over the hovercraft by  distracting gas back just when she's  about to escape with the power plant the  marshall comes in and points his gun at  her suddenly just as gasback is about to  kill a media his gun is shot out of his  hand vash appears much to everyone's  great surprise he reveals that he lived  by having the bullet lodge into an  incredibly tough piece of smoked meat in  his pocket he avoids drowning in the  quicksand by having millie and merrill  pull him out much to their shock gasback  challenges him for a one-on-one duel to  which vash and emilia agree vash draws  his gun and shoots him with extreme  precision despite having the power to  kill him he neglects gas back's vital  points indicating that he doesn't want  to kill him the dual ends with gas back  getting shot in the leg and shoulder he  tries to activate his trump card an  energy based weapon but emilia counters  it with a pair of strange metallic  gloves he recognizes the gloves as  something he made for his wife emilia  then reveals that gasback's wife was her  mother and she was born shortly after he  left for a robbery although he left his  family well stocked a rival gang broke  in and stole everything the neighbours  only watched the whole tragedy refusing  to help the family of an outlaw emedia's  mother soon dies as even the doctor  didn't help them emilia then aims her  gun a gas back but then exclaims that  she won't kill him just then kane  arrives with a missile planning on  killing all of them except himself  before he can do this wolfwood destroys  the missile with a single shot from his  cross punisher as the end credits roll  the town's restored once the plant is  brought back vash and wolf would  encounter merrill and mili who state  that kane was a criminal under a false  name so the insurance payment is now  null and void gasback kane the marshal  and the other henchmen are taken into  custody in a police caravan emilia is  watching them from a distance looking on  as her father stares thoughtfully out of  the cell window gaspak experiences a  flashback in which he's leaving for the  robbery and asks his wife to come with  them but his wife refuses to go with the  robber however she accepts the suitcase  given by him hoping to meet him again in  the future vash and wolfwood are then  seen still walking discussing the recent  events wolford brings up the point that  if vash hadn't saved gas back 20 years  ago amelia would never have been born a  newspaper clipping then blows into  vash's face and upon reading it it says  that they're going in a new direction  wolfwood sees that the paper says the  dodongo brothers have escaped from  prison and learns that vash may have  something to do with them so that's it  for today's video if you liked the video  give it a huge thumbs up and subscribe  to the channel for more anime recaps  farewell until the next video

